# The game's media lives next to the app, not in it. public/Pics, Sounds, Fonts and Mods are symlinks to ../../<same name>
# (recreate with: cd public && for d in Pics Sounds Fonts Mods; do ln -sfn ../../$d $d; done)
/public/Pics
/public/Sounds
/public/Fonts
/public/Mods